    "name": "Adobe Campaign Standard Transactional Messages API",
    "description": "REST API for Adobe Campaign Standard enabling integration with marketing campaigns, profiles, workflows, and messaging services. Provides CRUD operations for profiles and services, workflow control, transactional messaging triggers, GDPR/CCPA privacy requests, marketing history access, and custom resource management.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Adobe Developer Support",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
